{"id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-tm-runtime.md","title":"Turing-machine running time","display":"df-tm-runtime — Turing-machine running time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-tm-runtime","aliases":["27-df-tm-runtime"],"display":"df-tm-runtime — Turing-machine running time","depends_on":["[[27-df-turing-machine]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix B.3, running time","source_printed_pages":"618–619","source_pdf_pages":"642–643","verification_status":"source-description-checked-with-explicit-infinite-runtime-convention"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-tm-runtime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-tm-runtime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-runtime — Turing-machine running time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix B.3, running time"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"618–619"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"642–643"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-description-checked-with-explicit-infinite-runtime-convention"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\mathbb B^*\">\\(w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\)</span>；机器与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halt}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Halt}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a>。用序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 作为扩充自然数的无穷元，通常序数序延伸有限整数序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\},\\qquad\\infty\\coloneqq\\omega.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\},\\qquad\\infty\\coloneqq\\omega.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\coloneqq\\min\\left(\\{t\\in\\omega\\mid\\exists q\\in\\{1,2\\}\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Time}_M(w)\\coloneqq\\min\\left(\\{t\\in\\omega\\mid\\exists q\\in\\{1,2\\}\\;\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathcal U\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\mathrm{Halt}_M(w,t,q,\\tau,h)\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若机器不停机，值为 ∞；所以多项式上界中的比较有明确真假，不再对未定义部分函数直接比较。若停机则计转移步数，固定机型与 Appendix B.3 的运行时间相符。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","sta